          "transfer": "<p>Classify the two claims in your route, then rewrite them without an unsupported assertion.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Fresh source</th><th>Claims to check</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td><code>L3-W-X</code></td><td>The agenda&#x27;s assigned owner is Noor. Lee will invite participants. The meeting is Thursday. No agenda deadline is recorded.</td><td>“Lee is the assigned agenda owner.” “The agenda is due Wednesday.”</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>",
